        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DoralLock TK6411, Morant Lever Trim Kit for Handlesets</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe classic design and easy installation of the DoralLock Morant Lever, will not disappoint those looking for a simple leverset that will improve the look of any space. The Morant Lever Inside Trim Kit used with the DoralLock <a href=\"/products/hanover-single-cylinder-handleset-dorallock-803871b\">Hanover Handleset</a> and the <a href=\"/products/single-cylinder-montego-handleset-dorallock-810871\">Montego Handleset</a>. This is an replacement inside handle kit for these handelsets only as it is just the lever and rosette. It is available in 7 finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here or a complete <a href=\"/products/morant-leverset-dorallock-6410\">Morant Lever Set</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the DoralLock TK6411 Morant Lever Trim Kit:\r\n<li>Length: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Hole Spacing center to center: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DOR-TK6411-specifications.pdf?v=1704262207\" target=\"new\"><b>DoralLock TK6411 Morant Trim Kit (PDF)</b></a>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
